Power Board PCB file (textual): power_board.kicad_pcb

Board outline: 30mm x 25mm
Layer count: 2
Placement guidance:
- J1 BAT_CONN at left edge
- TP4056 footprint near mid-left with microUSB on left edge
- DW01+FS8205A protection near battery connector
- 3.3V buck (U3) center right, with inductor L1 above it and input/output caps nearby
- 5V boost converter U4 near right edge with large input caps and output inductor
- POWER_BUS JST 6-pin at bottom edge for harness to main board

High current routing notes:
- 5V_BCK traces width >= 1.0 mm
- BAT+ heavy trace to motor driver connector (if motor power routed via power board) — we route motor power direct from battery to motor driver board in harness

DRC notes: keep battery trace clear of sensitive analog nets
